# run_multiview_poc.py 审计清单

- [ ] protocol SHA与fixture内绑定精确一致
- [ ] case ID精确为MV1—MV6，candidate数精确为26
- [ ] 每项expected/observed verdict均写入矩阵
- [ ] controlled test精确运行16项且exit 0
- [ ] implementation receipt包含代码、ref、ai-check、fixture和协议
- [ ] 模型/Solver/DB/Redis/网络计数均为0
- [ ] D盘approved root、祖先symlink和append-once目标fail-closed
- [ ] partial中完成全部artifact后才原子rename
- [ ] final receipt列出每个primary artifact hash
- [ ] 非主张不把离线POC升级为角色或系统PASS
